		strong: 'Governed app generation for big organisations: central control of data, permissions and models, unlimited end users, and the option to run everything, including AI inference, in your own AWS, GCP or Azure account.',
		stops: 'SSO and source control are Enterprise only, and the Teams plan includes one hosted app. Superblocks describes its apps as React projects you can export; how much of the backend, integrations and workflows comes with them is not documented.',
